Hello All,

Thanks to FBB contributors Cathryn Malaga and Tom Sp2lob here is a new
F6FBB BBS released version 7.05f.

Enter into your favorite local AX.25 source directory.
Download the new version package :

wget http://f6bvp.free.fr/logiciels/BBS-f6fbb/xd705f-src.tar.bz2

tar xf xd705f-src.tar.bz2

If you want to know about the last version changes, read fbbsrc.705f/CHANGES

For installing the BBS :

cd fbbsrc.705f/src

stop the BBS by connecting from a local sysop console and enter command
/A

make

make install

Answer Yes

Restart bbs using fbb.sh script that will check for correct directory tree.

73 de Bernard, f6bvp

